# Keep the GitHub language bar focused on actual project source.
# Build scripts and OS-specific tooling are marked vendored so GitHub's
# linguist ignores them in language statistics. They still appear in the
# file tree and are still tracked — this is a display-only signal.

*.ps1          linguist-vendored
build_*.sh     linguist-vendored
build_*.ps1    linguist-vendored
*.spec         linguist-vendored
